-- Real supplier descriptions, from the Africa2Trust page text.
--
-- The import used a generated sentence because the directory's "description"
-- field is the same boilerplate for 80 of 81 suppliers: "Get to know X, our
-- background, profile information, and the public details we share...".
--
-- The genuine About copy was in the page text all along, after that sentence.
-- Roofings, for instance: "Founded by Dr. Sikander Lalani under license of the
-- Uganda Investment Authority, Roofings Group launched operations in 1994."
--
-- 79 suppliers, matched on company name. Trimmed to 1200 characters.
-- Only overwrites the generated text — a description a supplier has since
-- written for themselves is left alone.

